# QA DoD-4: 4P split-screen (quadrants, no minimap), mixed devices: P1 keyboard A, P2 gamepad,
# P3 keyboard B, P4 gamepad 2. Steering assist on → lobby → Backyard Bash, 1 lap, Storm (per-view
# rain + lightning) → P4 pauses (Start on pad 2) → P4 resumes → finish → results → scoreboard →
# Lobby (players kept) → Esc leaves the lobby → menu.
#   cargo run -p recharged -- --user-data-dir target/qa/data/vs4 --window 1600x900 \
#     --input-script tools/scripts/qa/vs4.script --exit-after 700
wait ui
wait screen title                  # the splash ends after its fade (frame clock)
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # Title
1.5 nav keyboardA up
0.3 nav keyboardA up
0.3 nav keyboardA up               # Settings
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
2.0 nav keyboardA prevTab          # Accessibility
0.6 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Steering assist
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
0.3 nav keyboardA back
1.5 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Versus
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
2.0 nav keyboardA confirm          # P1 joins (Space)
0.5 nav gamepad confirm            # P2 joins
0.5 nav keyboardB confirm          # P3 joins (Enter)
0.5 nav gamepad2 confirm           # P4 joins
0.5 nav gamepad right              # P2: Dumpster
0.3 nav keyboardB right
0.3 nav keyboardB right            # P3: Zip
0.3 nav gamepad2 down
0.3 nav gamepad2 right             # P4: paint 2
0.8 shot vs4_01_lobby
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
0.3 nav gamepad confirm
0.3 nav keyboardB confirm
0.3 nav gamepad2 confirm           # all ready → track select
2.5 nav keyboardA up
0.3 nav keyboardA left
0.3 nav keyboardA left             # Toy Town
0.3 nav keyboardA right
0.3 nav keyboardA right            # Backyard Bash
0.3 nav keyboardA right            # options: Layout
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Mirror
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Laps 5
0.3 nav keyboardA left
0.3 nav keyboardA left
0.3 nav keyboardA left
0.3 nav keyboardA left             # 1
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Rivals
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # AI difficulty
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Items
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Weather
0.3 nav keyboardA right
0.3 nav keyboardA right
0.3 nav keyboardA right            # Storm
0.6 shot vs4_02_track_select
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Time of day
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Start race
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
wait countdown
1.0 shot vs4_03_countdown
wait racing
hold keyboardA throttle 1
hold gamepad throttle 1
hold keyboardB throttle 1
hold gamepad2 throttle 1
@200 tap gamepad item
@200 tap keyboardB item
@300 shot vs4_04_racing
@540 shot vs4_05_racing_later
@560 release keyboardA
@560 release keyboardB
@560 release gamepad
@560 release gamepad2
0.2 tap gamepad2 pause             # P4: Start
wait paused
1.0 shot vs4_06_p4_pause
0.3 nav gamepad2 confirm           # Resume (P4)
wait running
0.2 hold keyboardA throttle 1
0.0 hold gamepad throttle 1
0.0 hold keyboardB throttle 1
0.0 hold gamepad2 throttle 1
wait finished
release keyboardA
release keyboardB
release gamepad
release gamepad2
3.5 shot vs4_07_results
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # Continue
2.0 shot vs4_08_scoreboard
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Lobby
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
wait menu
2.5 shot vs4_09_lobby_again
0.3 nav keyboardA back             # Esc (shared key, no slot): leaves the lobby
2.0 shot vs4_10_after_lobby
1.0 exit
